### Health
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### Shared assistants
GET http://localhost:8000/api/bots?shared_only=true

### Chat
POST http://localhost:8000/api/chat/message
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bot_id": "technician",
  "content": "Help me triage the battery warning on FM-4410."
}

### Fleet overview
GET http://localhost:8000/api/fleet/summary

### Maintenance agent
POST http://localhost:8000/api/agents/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "task_type": "maintenance_triage",
  "vehicle_id": "FM-4410"
}
